WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.190
- Your husband just released

00:00:01.190 --> 00:00:04.330
a new book featuring immigrant
paintings and stories.

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:07.030
When he started painting, he
wasn't as good as he is now,

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:08.580
I've heard, so how did you, as a teacher,

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.370
encourage his work or was
this like the speeches

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.773
and you just laid low?

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:17.140
- I laid low.
(laughing)

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:20.261
But actually he's really gotten good.

00:00:20.261 --> 00:00:24.260
I'm shocked, I mean he was
not interested in art at all.

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:27.090
The White House has a major
collection of American art

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:29.423
and of course he never
really looked at it.

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:33.030
So I was very surprised
when he took up painting

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:36.000
but he's gotten to be really good.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.630
That was one of his first paintings.

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:38.900
- [Kelly] That's amazing.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.950
- But now of course,
these are the portraits

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:44.290
of immigrants that are at
the Bush Center in Dallas.

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:46.910
And I wanna invite everybody,
come to the Bush Center

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:49.280
and see the paintings.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.170
They're immigrants that you know

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:54.170
like Henry Kissinger or Madeline Albright,

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:56.330
or then people that you don't know

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:58.690
that have immigrated to the United States

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:02.230
and it's their paintings, their
portraits and their stories.

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:03.510
- Oh man, they're beautiful.

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:05.520
I have tried so hard to paint.

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:08.353
I tell you what, I am the worst at it.

